{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/04/1335663/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日、代々木だー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっとどきどきが止まりません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どきどきどきどきどきどき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どきどき..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっどっどっどっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どどどどどどどどどどど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずどどどどどだぢづでど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/04/1335663/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"混乱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/04/1335663/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントいっぱい\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにたくさんの方が\n読んでくれてると思ったら\n嬉しくて嬉しくてー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...はあああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の写真も前回と一緒"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/04/1335663/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい撮ってもらったの。\nまだあるから載せたいけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが忘れた頃に載せようかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/04/1335663/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真の加工はなんてゆーアプリ？\n▶︎加工は\nLINEcamera、Pixlromatic\n文字はPhonto"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海外の絵本とか好きなのかな？\n▶︎大好き。日本の絵本もすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"500回目BLOGの\nマグカップの中には\n何が入ってたの？？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎かわいいラテアート！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/04/1335663/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、ちょっと飲んだ後。\n吸い込まれそうなくま！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに、読み返す事とか有りますか？\n▶︎ありますー\n変な文だなーって思って反省したり...\nどんな写真載せたか確認したり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに質問回答しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/04/1335663/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日も頑張る！！ぬぁ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/04/1335663/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、さっきから\n家に蚊がいるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい刺されてるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かゆいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蚊よ！去れー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}